---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="TechPilot AI — Practical AI & Tech Guides" description="Discover useful AI tools, clear software tutorials, and honest technology explainers that help you work smarter.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Your guide to smarter technology</span>
    <h1>Make AI work for you.<br /><span style="color:var(--mint)">Not the other way around.</span></h1>
    <p>Practical guides, thoughtful tool reviews, and straightforward tech advice—so you can spend less time figuring things out and more time getting things done.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:27px">
      <a class="header-cta" href="/ai-tools/">Explore AI tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/how-to/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#d4dbee">Browse tutorials <span style="margin-left:8px">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><h2>Find your next useful tool</h2><p>Clear starting points for real-world tasks.</p></div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/ai-tools/">All AI tools ↗</a>
  </div>
  <section class="card-grid" aria-label="Explore topics">
    <a class="content-card" href="/ai-tools/">
      <span class="card-icon">✳</span><span class="card-tag">Discover</span>
      <h3>AI tools, explained</h3><p>Understand what popular AI tools do, who they help, and where their limits are.</p><span class="card-arrow">Explore tools ↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="content-card" href="/how-to/">
      <span class="card-icon">⌘</span><span class="card-tag">Learn</span>
      <h3>Step-by-step how-to guides</h3><p>Follow practical walkthroughs for software, productivity, and everyday tech.</p><span class="card-arrow">Read guides ↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="content-card" href="/reviews/">
      <span class="card-icon">◈</span><span class="card-tag">Choose wisely</span>
      <h3>Reviews & comparisons</h3><p>Compare features, trade-offs, and pricing before you commit to a tool.</p><span class="card-arrow">Compare options ↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-band">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span><h2>Useful beats complicated.</h2><p>Technology moves quickly. We aim to make it easier to understand with plain-English explanations, practical examples, and a focus on what actually matters to you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet TechPilot AI ↗</a></div>
    <div class="feature-stat"><strong>Practical by design</strong><span>We focus on clear steps, realistic use cases, transparent limitations, and decisions you can make with confidence.</span></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
